        <span style="font-size:1.2rem;">🧩</span>
        <span>Cloudflare Agent Memory</span>
        <span style="font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--muted);font-weight:400;">cf-memory-plugin</span>
        <span style="font-size:0.65rem;background:#2a1a1a;color:var(--accent);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:8px;margin-left:auto;">Alpha</span>
      </div>
      <p style="font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.45;">Persistent memory for agents. You call HTTP. Cloudflare stores and recalls. Built for <a href="https://alfred.report" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--accent-dim);">alfred.report</a>.</p>
      <p style="font-size:0.8rem;margin:0;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px 14px;">
        <a href="https://github.com/hansakoch/cf-memory-plugin" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--accent-dim);">https://github.com/hansakoch/cf-memory-plugin</a>
        <a href="https://cloudflare-memory.pages.dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--accent-dim);">https://cloudflare-memory.pages.dev</a>
        <a href="https://alfred.report" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--accent-dim);">https://alfred.report</a>
      </p>
    </div>
    <a href="https://openroyleal.com" target="_blank" style="background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--text);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-weight:500;font-size:0.93rem;transition:all 0.2s;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);" onmouseover="this.style.borderColor='var(--accent-dim)';this.style.boxShadow='0 4px 20px rgba(255,51,51,0.15)'" onmouseout="this.style.borderColor='var(--border)';this.style.boxShadow='0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.2)'">
